    <item>
      <title>ChatGPT 直接接入电子健康记录，把 AI 嵌入临床日常流程</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/gpt/post/20260901/ChatGPT-%E7%9B%B4%E6%8E%A5%E6%8E%A5%E5%85%A5%E7%94%B5%E5%AD%90%E5%81%A5%E5%BA%B7%E8%AE%B0%E5%BD%95%E6%8A%8A-AI-%E5%B5%8C%E5%85%A5%E4%B8%B4%E5%BA%8A%E6%97%A5%E5%B8%B8%E6%B5%81%E7%A8%8B/</link>
